 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "slate",
   "title": "What is simulated, and the clock",
   "items": [
    "The Harness lane is a stand-in for the codex binary (sim/bin/codex, outside the repository), launched with the real recipe of config/harnesses.toml: it loads the files Codex loads, makes one model call, then budget_status, spawn_agent, the four files and deliver",
    "The other lanes are Frontier's own code at db900a0, its workspace files and the real OpenAI API: gpt-6-astra through the gateway, gpt-6-luna for the sub-agent",
    "Times are seconds since the first event of trace.jsonl, from its call events per process and thread"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Launcher: frontier/launcher.py",
   "items": [
    "run_one 332-360: build_session 338, session_start 339, run_until 346, metered check 348-356 (gateway entry found, so no usage_from_report), session_end 357-358",
    "build_session 67-102: HTTPS_PROXY to the filter and 127.0.0.1 in NO_PROXY (84-87), FRONTIER_STATE (94), route_args point codex at the gateway (99-101)",
    "run_until 256-267: codex in its own process group, timeout seconds_left (270-273)",
    "session loop 424-441: _stop_reason 425 (474-501; delivered at 476-477), run_one 440, commit Session n 441; finally 442-450: stop.set, gw.shutdown, finish",
    "finish 454-471: end_leftovers 458 (214-245), final_costs 464 (mission.py 516-527: COSTS.md, delivery.json), commit Delivery and tag 465 (snapshots.py 186-203)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "violet",
   "title": "MCP server",
   "items": [
