    "frontier/agent.py: Agent.__init__ 160-174, _system 176-190 (system.md; cloud.md with infra tools; subagents.md and roles/*.md with spawn_agent: the sub-agent, with no tools, reads system.md only), run_task 192-231, t_spawn_agent 249-277, take_agent_slot 89-94, over_budget 56-61, Run.log 51-54",
